{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://hk.on.cc/hk/bkn/cnt/news/20261122/photo/bkn-20261122135510188-1122_00822_001_01p.jpg?20261122145129\"/><p>現場為西九龍中心。（馬竟峯攝）</p><p>西九龍中心扶手梯有人跌倒。今午(22日)1時42分，欽州街37K號西九龍中心一名女長者，在扶手梯跌倒，並陷入昏迷。救援人員趕往現場，將事主送院治理，事主其後回復清醒。警員正調查事件經過及原因。</p><p>on.cc東網</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-22T07:03:48.474849+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":120,"images":1,"source":"東網 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-22T05:55:10+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-22T09:57:15.588874+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-22T06:57:23.599117+00:00","content_hash":"fa8ea03805e2cdec3b698601c7ded8c62fdcd49766d91af88eb8804634c99832","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}